        "title": "In vitro inhibition of simvastatin metabolism, a HMG-CoA reductase inhibitor in human and rat liver by bergamottin, a component of grapefruit juice.",
        "authorString": "Le Goff-Klein N, Koffel JC, Jung L, Ubeaud G.",
